WEBVTT

00:04:28.236 --> 00:04:32.676
Then the issue is about giving
people booster shots.

00:04:32.716 --> 00:04:33.876
So right now,

00:04:33.876 --> 00:04:36.436
if you're asking a clear question,

00:04:36.436 --> 00:04:38.116
of today,

00:04:38.116 --> 00:04:41.996
with the bivalent BA.4-5 boosters

00:04:41.996 --> 00:04:47.036
or updated vaccines
is a better terminology to use,

00:04:47.036 --> 00:04:50.116
they are available now
throughout the country.

00:04:50.436 --> 00:04:53.996
We've ordered 171 million doses.

00:04:54.356 --> 00:04:55.996
Who should get it?

00:04:56.036 --> 00:05:01.796
Anyone who is vaccinated
with the primary series